OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say they will fight data
OL,4,Aand solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build one of England's largest
OL,7,Fsolar farms and a huge data centre have
OL,8,Fbeen described as "extremely
OL,9,Foppressive" for an agricultural
OL,10,Flandscape.
OL,12,FSome 550 people watched a King's Lynn
OL,13,Fand West Norfolk Borough Council
OL,14,Fmeeting on Monday, which was also
OL,15,Flivestreamed, to discuss the
OL,16,Finfrastructure projects near King's
OL,17,FLynn, Norfolk.
OL,19,FThe Longmarsh Green Energy (LGE)
OL,20,Fdevelopments would cover 4,695 acres
OL,21,F(1,900 hectares) of farmland across two
OL,22,Fsites.
